# route-roundtrip (h10-page): the viewer with func=x2&a=2&h=1; the wordmark
# home; 1 s; the button back; 2 s; the shot: the viewer on x at a 1, h 0
# with the hash bare and the menu closed. Behaviour: the route and url lines
# at each step.
# Phase 1 reaches the viewer with a mid-run hash edit (no `route` line yet);
# phase 2 opens it with one (h10-t-route).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
hash func=x2&a=2&h=1
wait 500
click 104 48
wait 1000
click 233 553
wait 2000
shot route-roundtrip
